    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Wax Sii Sheegid Ku Saabsan Masar",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanu waa warka culus ee Masar ku saabsan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bal eega, Rabbigu wuxuu fuushan yahay daruur dheeraysa oo wuxuu u socdaa Masar, oo sanamyada Masarna waxay ku gariiri doonaan hortiisa, oo Masriyiinta qalbigooduna cabsi buu kula dhex dhalaali doonaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Masriyiinta waxaan ku kicin doonaa Masriyiin kale, oo midkood kastaaba wuxuu la diriri doonaa walaalkiis iyo deriskiisa, magaalaba magaalay la diriri doontaa, boqortooyana boqortooyo kale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Masriyiinta ruuxooduna wuu ka dhammaan doonaa, oo taladooda waan baabbi'in doonaa, oo waxay talo u doonan doonaan sanamyada, iyo falanfallowyada, iyo kuwa ruuxaanta leh, iyo saaxiriinta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Sayidka ah Rabbiga ciidammadu wuxuu leeyahay, Anigu waxaan Masriyiinta gacanta u gelin doonaa sayid nac weyn, oo waxaa u talin doona boqor xoog badan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo biyuhuna badda way ka madhan doonaan, oo webiguna wuu gudhi doonaa oo engegi doonaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo webiyaashuna way qudhmi doonaan oo durdurrada Masarna way madhan doonaan oo engegi doonaan, oo cawsduurka iyo dareemaduna way wada qallali doonaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo seeraha Webi Niil oo qarkiisa ku yaal, iyo wax kasta oo lagu beeray Webi Niil agtiisuba way wada engegi doonaan, oo dabayshaa la tegi doonta, oo mar dambena lama arki doono. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo kalluumaystayaashuna way ooyi doonaan, kuwa jillaabka Webi Niil ku rida oo dhammuna way wada barooran doonaan, oo kuwa biyaha korkooda shabagga ku kala bixiyaana way macaluuli doonaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo kuwa geed linenka dharka ka sameeya iyo kuwa cudbiga dharka ka sameeyaaba way quusan doonaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo kuwa waddanka tiirarka u ah oo dhammuna way wada jabi doonaan, kuwa kiro u shaqeeyaana way murugoon doonaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amiirrada Socan waa nacasyo, oo taladii taliyayaasha ugu xigmad badnaa ee Fircoon waxay noqotay doqonnimo. Sidee baad Fircoon ugu tidhaahdaan, Anigu waxaan ahay nin xigmad leh wiilkiis, oo waxaan ahay farcankii boqorradii hore? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddaba meeye raggaaga xigmadda lahu? Oo bal haatan ha kuu sheegeen, oo ha ogaadeen waxa Rabbiga ciidammadu Masar ugu talo galay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amiirradii Socan waxay noqdeen nacasyo, oo amiirradii Nofna waa la khiyaaneeyey Masarna waxaa qalday kuwa qabiilooyinkeeda tiirarka u ah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Rabbigu wuxuu ku dhex qasay wareer, oo iyana waxay Masar shuqulladeedii oo dhan ugu qaldeen sida nin sakhraanu mantaggiisa ugu dhacdhaco oo kale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Masarna laguma arki doono shuqul ay samayn karaan madaxa ama dabadu, laanta ama cawsduurku toona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo wakhtigaas Masriyiintu waxay noqon doonaan sida naago oo kale, oo waxay la gariiri doonaan oo la cabsan doonaan ruxruxidda gacanta Rabbiga ciidammada, oo uu Masar korkeeda ku ruxruxi doono. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo dalka Yahuudahna cabsi buu Masar u noqon doonaa, oo mid kasta oo la xusuusiyaaba wuu ka cabsan doonaa, waana talada Rabbiga ciidammadu uu iyaga u goostay aawadeed.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo wakhtigaas waxaa dalka Masar jiri doona shan magaalo oo afka Kancaan ku hadasha oo Rabbiga ciidammada ku dhaarata, oo middoodna waxaa lagu magacaabi doonaa Magaalada baabba'a.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo wakhtigaas dalka Masar dhexdiisa meel allabari baa Rabbiga ugu oolli doonta, oo soohdinteedana waxaa Rabbiga u jiri doona tiir. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo taasu waxay calaamad iyo markhaati dalka Masar dhexdiisa ugu noqon doontaa Rabbiga ciidammada, waayo, kuwa dulma aawadood ayay Rabbiga ugu qayshan doonaan, oo isna wuxuu u soo diri doonaa badbaadiye iyo mid xoog badan, wuuna samatabbixin doonaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo wakhtigaas ayaa Rabbigu Masriyiinta is-ogeysiin doonaa, oo ay Masriyiintuna Rabbiga aqoon doonaan, oo waxay ku caabudi doonaan allabari iyo qurbaan, oo Rabbiga ayay nidar u nidri doonaan, wayna oofin doonaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Rabbigu wax buu Masar ku dhufan doonaa, wax buu ku dhufan doonaa, wuuna dawayn doonaa, oo iyana Rabbigay u soo noqon doonaan, oo isna baryootankooda ayuu aqbali doonaa, wuuna bogsiin doonaa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo wakhtigaas waxaa jiri doona jid weyn oo Masar ka baxa oo tan iyo Ashuur gaadha, oo kuwa reer Ashuur ah ayaa Masar geli doona, oo Masriyiintuna reer Ashuur bay Ilaah la caabudi doonaan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo wakhtigaas dalka Israa'iil wuxuu saddex ku noqon doonaa Masar iyo Ashuur, oo dhulka dhexdiisana barako buu ku ahaan doonaa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "waayo, Rabbiga ciidammadu wuu barakeeyey, isagoo leh, Barako waxaa leh Masar oo ah dadkayga, iyo Ashuur oo ah shuqulkii gacmahayga, iyo Israa'iil oo ah dhaxalkayga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
